{% extends '@CitadelAureum/core/docs/layout.html.twig' %}

{% block article %}
    <p>
        Restaurants is the dining directory staff use when guests ask "where
        should we eat tonight?": a curated list of places nearby, organised by
        cuisine, with dietary options and the team's own verdict.
    </p>

    <h2>Common tasks</h2>
    <ol class="au-docs-steps">
        <li>Open <strong>Directory → Restaurants</strong> and filter by cuisine or dietary requirements.</li>
        <li>
            Vote restaurants up or down. Votes are how the team's experience
            accumulates. Recommend the places guests come back happy from.
        </li>
        <li>With manage permission, add new restaurants or update details when menus and opening hours change.</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="au-docs-note">
        <i class="ph ph-info"></i>
        <p>
            Anyone who can view the module can vote; adding and editing
            restaurants needs manage permission.
        </p>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
